"Your June Website Report Card: F ↓

Joe's HVAC: your June website report card is F — down from A last time
Health score: 30.5 / 100 — Down from A (96.6 → 30.5)

Joe's HVAC scored 30.5 out of 100 this June. We found 3 things worth fixing, listed below from most to least important.

WHAT'S GOING WELL
  + Google Safe Browsing reports your site clean — no malware or phishing warnings.

WORTH YOUR ATTENTION
  1. Website was unreachable
     When we checked, your website answered with an error (HTTP 503) instead of loading.
     Why it matters: Every minute your site is down, customers who look for you find nothing — most will not try again.
  2. Security certificate expiring soon
     Your site's security certificate expires in 8 days.
     Why it matters: If it lapses, every visitor sees a full-page security warning instead of your website.
  3. Not showing up in local search
     Your website is not in the top 50 Google results for 2 of 3 searches we track ("hvac repair austin", "ac repair austin"). Customers searching those terms find coolbreezehvac.com and austinairpros.com instead.
     Why it matters: If you are invisible in local search, nearby customers are choosing competitors without ever seeing you.

THIS MONTH'S ONE THING
  Start with the most important fix: website was unreachable. Every minute your site is down, customers who look for you find nothing — most will not try again.

CATEGORY SCORES
  Uptime & availability: 0
  Performance: 48
  Mobile friendliness: 60
  Local search visibility: 8
  Listing consistency: 50
  Content & technical hygiene: 65
  Security & trust: 34

Want this fixed? Just reply to this email and we'll take it from there.
SiteVitals watches https://joes-hvac.com so you don't have to."
`;
